      "id": "pcp-short-forward-statement",
      "section": "1",
      "role": "explains",
      "quote": "**Theorem 1.1 (PCP theorem; [AS98, ALMSS98]).** For every language $\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{*}$ in NP, there are a polynomial-time verifier $V$, natural numbers $\\alpha,\\beta,\\ell$, and a polynomial $p\\in\\mathbb N[X]$ with the following properties.",
      "lean": [
        "PCP.np_subset_pcp"
      ],
      "anchor": {
